<title>EGYPT: SOCCER-ZAMALEK WIN AFRICAN CHAMPIONS' CUP IN PENALTY SHOOT-OUT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ZAMALEK WIN AFRICAN CHAMPIONS' CUP IN PENALTY SHOOT-OUT.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the African Champions' Cup final, second leg played at the Cairo stadium on Friday:</p>
<p>Zamalek (Egypt) 2 Shooting Stars (Nigeria) 1 (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Zamalek - Mehdad Abdelhadi (27), Ayman Mansour (66)</p>
<p>Shooting Stars - Gbenga Okunowo (88)</p>
<p>Aggregate score 3-3. Zamalek won 5-4 on penalties.</p>
<p>Attendance: 80,000</p>
</text>
